date: 2025-11-04T00:00:00-04:00
---

The Second Sun Diner is a family restaurant in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/index|Sableclutch]], built like an old diner with a checkered floor and red booths. The ceiling is painted a flat yellow that stands in for the sun and hurts to look at. The menu runs to paninis, burgers, chicken nuggets, little hot dogs and fries, and the house specialty is the Aurora sundae, three scoops of green, pink and purple ice cream. A [[Phenomena/Radar Dishes|radar dish]] sits on the roof with wires running down into the building, and a conduit and a painted box are hidden in the ceiling, the same fittings seen at a roller rink elsewhere in the city.

The [[Org/Roundhat Gang/index|Roundhat Gang]] installed the dish, and the restaurant is tied to the gang, whether they own the building and business or take the dish as part of a protection fee. During the endless rain, the Party cut the dish's wires and bent the dish to spoil the signal. Johnny staged a scene over a hair in his ice cream to draw the manager out of the back office and got a gift card for it, but the party never got a look at the gang's paperwork.
